  "name": "Pact Worlds",
  "description": "The solar system centuries After the Gap — the mysterious event that erased a hundred years of galactic memory. United by the Pact Council, the surviving worlds banded together around Absalom Station, the artificial ring-world hub of trade, diplomacy, and starfaring life, where humans, androids, kasathas, lashuntas, shirrens, vesk, ysoki, and dozens of stranger folk share the same bustling decks. No single species holds a majority here — the Pact Worlds are cosmopolitan by necessity, built from whoever survived the Gap and everyone who's arrived since.",
